<h1 class="gl-mb-5 gl-text-size-h2 gl-hidden md:gl-block">
Welcome to GNOME GitLab
</h1>
<div class="md" id="js-custom-sign-in-description"><p data-sourcepos="1:1-2:26" dir="auto">gitlab.gnome.org is a GitLab instance dedicated to development of the GNOME&#x000A;project and its ecosystem.</p>&#x000A;<p data-sourcepos="4:1-4:109" dir="auto"><strong data-sourcepos="4:1-4:109">If you would like to contribute, you can <a data-sourcepos="4:44-4:106" href="https://register.gitlab.gnome.org/" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">create a new account here</a>.</strong></p>&#x000A;<p data-sourcepos="6:1-7:54" dir="auto">Contributors associated with the GNOME Foundation should use their GNOME account&#x000A;to sign in by using the "GNOME Keycloak" login option.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md order-md-12">
<div class="col-sm-12 bar">
<div class="gl-text-center gl-mb-5">
<img alt="Welcome to GNOME GitLab" class="gl-invisible gl-h-10 js-portrait-logo-detection lazy" data-src="/assets/logo-911de323fa0def29aaf817fca33916653fc92f3ff31647ac41d2c39bbe243edb.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" />
<h1 class="gl-mb-3 gl-text-size-h2 md:gl-hidden">
Welcome to GNOME GitLab
</h1>
</div>

